### Login
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@gmail.com",
    "password": "Admin123"
}

### 1. Check availability
GET {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/availability
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._8_PsHNeW8Oiv4JWmWu2qnPgqMxntVWyBNAvdNkzmaI

### 2. Issue Ticket
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._8_PsHNeW8Oiv4JWmWu2qnPgqMxntVWyBNAvdNkzmaI
{
  "vehicleNumber": "TRK-002",
  "vehicleType": "Truck"
}

### 3. Calculate Exit Fee
PATCH {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets/1/exit
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._8_PsHNeW8Oiv4JWmWu2qnPgqMxntVWyBNAvdNkzmaI

### 4. Record Payment
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._8_PsHNeW8Oiv4JWmWu2qnPgqMxntVWyBNAvdNkzmaI

{ 
    "paymentMethod": "Cash" 
}